{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "60ec5b7b9f467e9f536fa1e02132509eda0359408e45ec5029e51d868b64fb5c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nゴメンゴメン、わかってるんだけどさ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n抱歉、抱歉，这个我知道啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2d3f9acfd3e9c6717f907a0e7b216d7f8b284285106acc43214a9009721c957d", "ja": "この衣装着てると、つい踊っちゃうんだよね！\n体が勝手に動くって言うか……。", "zh": "只是穿着这套服装，我就忍不住想跳舞耶！\n就像是身体自己动了起来一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "02a94d1ec40efab32036a413afcd915091d997f6e276a313aea68cb156b13f77", "ja": "そういえば、ブログにも書いていたな……。\nそんなに踊りたくなるのか？", "zh": "这么一说，你在部落格上好像也有提到……\n真的会那么想跳舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56b0aaff8f6bd0ca5a07e107db5f4d770f05a2ef4e358fa3e97e732658dc0c06", "ja": "うん！　ホントは今すぐにでも、\nストリートで踊り出したいくらいなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯！其实我现在就很想\n冲上街头跳个痛快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c3e4cfadd08753fcde12db4876e7290d1c94d848a6779d48f70b841c3ce79454", "ja": "アイドルが勝手にストリートで踊ってたら、\n{$P$}が困るだろうなって。", "zh": "不过又想到要是偶像擅自跑到街头跳舞，\n{$P$}应该会很伤脑筋吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1007_p", "source_sha256": "71d999a58a9bc46b127a7ccbe93a8ff980acea3bcffcebc4c0dfd58573ce4020", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\n歩が思いとどまってくれてよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，没错。\n步，幸好你只是想想而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
