{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0044_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d30019b1cb68943d60ebcb65ef41760342d1bf5c754363b94881f16821c4538c", "ja": "そう慌てなくても、次の公演はもうすぐじゃないか。", "zh": "用不着那么急，下次公演不是快到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
